"""
company_database.py
-------------------
Comprehensive database of Product and Service companies operating in India
or offering remote jobs to Indian candidates.

Sources / References:
- NASSCOM member list: https://www.nasscom.in/member-company
- Tracxn / Crunchbase valuations (approximate)
- Company career pages (verified where possible)

Tier definitions:
  Product companies:
    Tier 1 = valuation > $1B  (MAANG, global SaaS, Indian unicorns)
    Tier 2 = valuation $100M-$1B  (mid-tier SaaS, funded startups)
    Tier 3 = valuation < $100M  (smaller startups, niche product cos)

  Service companies:
    Tier 1 = revenue / valuation > $1B
    Tier 2 = $100M-$1B
    Tier 3 = < $100M

Each entry is a dict:
  name            : str
  career_url      : str   -- direct link to careers/jobs page
  tier            : int   -- 1, 2 or 3
  company_type    : str   -- "product" or "service"
  valuation_usd_b : float -- approximate USD billions (0 if unknown)
  india_office    : bool
  remote          : bool  -- offers remote roles to India
  ats_type        : str   -- one of the ATS_TYPES list below
  hq              : str   -- "City, Country"
  india_hq        : str   -- primary India office city ("" if none)
"""

